[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1922.23, "timestamp": "00:32:02", "text": "很多类似子组件的东西，你可以……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1924.789, "timestamp": "00:32:04", "text": "点击这里。点击星星。检查一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1926.87, "timestamp": "00:32:06", "text": "看看这些能力是否让你感觉合适。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1927.909, "timestamp": "00:32:07", "text": "合身。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1932.31, "timestamp": "00:32:12", "text": "呃，德鲁伊，呃，职业。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1934.23, "timestamp": "00:32:14", "text": "哦，我也可以，我也可以，呃，等等。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1937.43, "timestamp": "00:32:17", "text": "你也可以像……嗯，如果你……的话，可以进行屏幕共享。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1940.07, "timestamp": "00:32:20", "text": "如果你不知道它在哪里，那确实会这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1942.389, "timestamp": "00:32:22", "text": "是的。嗯，这样可以。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1945.83, "timestamp": "00:32:25", "text": "哦，等等。呃，这是方差吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1947.269, "timestamp": "00:32:27", "text": "特征？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1949.909, "timestamp": "00:32:29", "text": "哦，给你。这里。坚持，稍等。嗯，我想我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1952.95, "timestamp": "00:32:32", "text": "给你看看。你能看到我能看到什么吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1955.029, "timestamp": "00:32:35", "text": "看？是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1957.11, "timestamp": "00:32:37", "text": "好的。是的。好的。所以，总而言之"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1959.19, "timestamp": "00:32:39", "text": "这里，呃，这一切就像结束了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1961.029, "timestamp": "00:32:41", "text": "这里就像是小巷。我这就去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1963.75, "timestamp": "00:32:43", "text": "比如查看星级。所以，是的，这一切都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1967.19, "timestamp": "00:32:47", "text": "比如你的，呃，德鲁伊的基本能力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1969.99, "timestamp": "00:32:49", "text": "呃，这个，然后这边，是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1971.669, "timestamp": "00:32:51", "text": "蓝色的那件将是你的班级，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1975.669, "timestamp": "00:32:55", "text": "子职业专属能力。嗯，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1979.59, "timestamp": "00:32:59", "text": "又怎么了？嗯，经销商，你可以做这些事。"}]